# Files graphify should not index.
#
# Minified vendor bundles. mermaid.min.js alone minted 3,116 nodes — a quarter
# of the whole graph — with labels like `$2e()`, `_6e()`, `a2()`. It swamped
# the god-node list and nine of the ten largest communities with someone
# else's compressed identifiers, which say nothing about this codebase.
#
# Deliberately narrow: `docs/manual` itself STAYS indexed. It is the MkDocs
# source for the user manual — 51 hand-written pages describing how the ERP
# actually works — and excluding the directory to be rid of one bundle would
# throw all of that away.
*.min.js
*.min.css

# Source maps: machine-generated, and they carry a copy of the bundle.
*.map
